sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant H as Helpers
    participant Q as queue.py
    participant R as Redis
    participant App as Mobile app
    O->>H: consolidate(results)
    H-->>O: highest risk + all explanations
    O->>H: apply_fda_rules(response)
    H-->>O: safe text + disclaimer
    O->>H: build_save_assessment_job()
    H-->>O: SaveAssessmentJob
    O->>Q: enqueue(job)
    Q->>R: XADD
    Note over Q: Redis down: the job goes to a local file instead
    O-->>App: 200 + prediction_id
